both formulations decreased the body weight gain and ovary
and liver weight;

• increases in atretic
follicles, interstitial fibrosis and
decreased mature follicles;

• alterations
in the serum concentrations of both progesterone
and estrogen;

• changes in the expression
of GnRH, LHR, FSHR, 3β-HSD
and Cyp19a1 genes at the HPO axis;

•
increases in the activity of T-AOC, CAT and GSH-Px, as
well as the MDA content in both the serum and ovary;
